":"data/corpus/shiji/080.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p005","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/080.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p006","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/080.json"}],"rationale":"樂閒明示為樂毅子，樂叔明示為孫，不補闕代父親；樂乘為樂閒宗不補兄弟。燕王喜來書及趙襄王君序各限本段，曹相國未見名字不回填。河上丈人至蓋公師承不作父子。依本篇明示姓名、君序與來書答書範圍暫接；燕惠王來書寡人指惠王、將軍指樂毅，樂毅答書先王指昭王、足下君王指惠王。伍子胥引古首吳王指闔閭，後吳王在夫差賜鴟夷後指夫差。父兄與群臣不補具體親屬，王齊為反間假說不作授王爵。"},{"id":"d-shiji082-009","person_id":"ez6_e2l_0ml","surfaces":["騎劫"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-082-tiandan"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p002","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/082.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p005","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/082.json"}],"rationale":"依9段明示姓名、君序與復齊事件暫接；法章立齊王與襄王迎莒、末段立襄王依同一復國敘事接。嬓女太史氏女君王后按明示，嬓與女先處完整稱謂。假神師是未名卒、臣其自稱，君指田單；燕將未名不盲接騎劫，宗族不補父母。誘王蠋授將被固謝，不當實授。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji130-late45-102","person_id":"ez6_e2l_0ml","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-130-taishigong","c-shiji-082-tiandan"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","source_context_confidence":"high_contextual","surfaces":["騎劫"],"identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context","target_mention_ids":["c-shiji-130-taishigong:m094-0018"]},"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p094","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/130.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p002","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/082.json"}],"prior_source_qualifications":[{"source_mention_ids":["c-shiji-130-taishigong:m094-0018"],"metadata":{"label":"騎劫（太史公自序候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"original_registry_record_sha256":"647e429393368188fb6b6e284d71c7284ba58315872e4be61849b3fc59db6395","qualification":"合併前來源限定人物label/status/historicity逐值保留；非對現役人物資格的改寫。"}],"rationale":"燕惠王使騎劫代樂毅、005為田單破殺同走騎劫。 僅辨同一來源人物，保原字、篇題引用、人名錨及頻次；不由此新增親屬或紀